---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Icon from '../assets/svg/asterisk.svg';
---
<BaseLayout>
    <h1>CRÉDITOS
    </h1>
    <p>Muchas gracias a las personas cuyos aportes hicieron esta página posible.</p>
    <ul class="mt-5">
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://icon-sets.iconify.design" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>Iconify Icons</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">SVGs de Bootstrap Icons, Boxicons and Charm Icons.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R7b3OlEyqug" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>Coding2GO</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">Tutorial para display:grids y dropdowns animados.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://dev.to/mino89/incredibly-simple-talk-bubbles-with-tailwind-4fe0" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>Pierdomenico Reitano (Dev.to)</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">Burbuja de texto en Tailwind para la línea de tiempo</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://www.vecteezy.com/vector-art/50521743-asterisk-icon-set-stylized-black-star-symbols-variations-with-different-line-effects" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>Nares Chaladkit (Vecteezy)</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">Vector asterisco</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Michroma?preview.script=Latn" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>Vernon Adams (Google Fonts)</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">Michroma Font</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://github.com/EmaSuriano/astro-frame-shift" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>EmaSuriano (Github)</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">Astro Frame Shift template (Usada de referencia para la galería)</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex flex-col py-2"><a href="https://webcoreui.dev/" class="border-b-2 border-fuchsia-900 border-dotted text-[1.25em] lg:text-[1em] text-fuchsia-900 uppercase leading-6 flex gap-1 font-black hover:tracking-wide transform-all duration-75">
                        <Icon width={20} height={20} fill={"currentColor"} class="icon opacity-100"/>Webcoreui</a>
                        <span class="text-[0.75em]">Componente de Carrusel para el portafolio</span>
                    </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Inspiración</h2>
    <p>El layout de esta pagina está fuertemente inspirado en distintos álbumes del género "chill out", especialmente <strong>The Best of Chillout de Music Brokers</strong> y <strong>The Ultimate Chillout de Nettwerk</strong>.</p>
</BaseLayout>